い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それでも国を救うため、身も心も捧げて主人公に尽くそうと頑張っちゃう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とのエッチを通じて、どんどん淫乱に……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25008","sourceWorkId":"8327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が召還された世界のお姫様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとり、巨乳、優しい、泣き虫、自信なし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の国を救うため、身も心も主人公にＨに尽くしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「か、神様！　私でよろしければ……国を救うためにお使いください"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"205988"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/96/96a2bd2cf2e84fe3a189ec8ad39b658b98b7d5a8de1f75b7afabf00bfe742224.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a466ba4ec8e43b98b61fffb5d420b182a18feefb80359c454fd9bd43de0a9e4.webp","width":126,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天天","creatorId":"vndb:s2922","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2922","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2922","name":"天天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:517030:205988:18086:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c44767","characterName":"パセリ＝グロウ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"205989","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"517030"}],"egsCharacterIds":["25009"],"vndbCharacterId":"c44767"},"originalCharacterName":"パセリ＝グロウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からフィアナの面倒を見ているフィアナお付きの専属侍女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"儀式を司る一族の娘で、その儀式の大切さをフィアナに説いてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛い顔に似合わず、クールでかなりの毒舌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因みにのんべぇで脱ぎ上戸。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"25009","sourceWorkId":"8327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃からフ